OL,3,GNEWSA'Safety first' as wedding guests
OL,4,Astranded on island after Storm Boelo
OL,5,
OL,6,FGuests attending a wedding on an island
OL,7,Fin Lower Lough Erne in County Fermanagh
OL,8,Fended up stranded after a ferry took on
OL,9,Fwater during Storm Boelo.
OL,11,FAt the weekend, the storm brought winds
OL,12,Fof almost 80mph (129km/h) in some parts
OL,13,Fof Northern Ireland and caused the
OL,14,Fcancellation of flights and ferries.
OL,16,FAbout 12,500 households were left
OL,17,Fwithout electricity as a result of the
OL,18,Fstorm, although all have since had
OL,19,Fpower restored, according to Northern
OL,20,FIreland Electricity Networks.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
