OL,3,GNEWSA'Safety first' as wedding guests
OL,4,Astranded on island after Storm Boelo
OL,5,
OL,6,FFurther strong winds - of up to 65mph
OL,7,F(105km/h) - are expected on Monday
OL,8,Fnight, with the Met Office issuing a
OL,9,Fyellow weather warning for coastal
OL,10,Fareas in counties Antrim and Down from
OL,11,F18:00 GMT until 03:00 on Tuesday.
